# TEMPLATES/ENGINEERING_BASELINE_TEMPLATE

REG（`CORE/01_REQUIREMENT_RULES.md`）的标准产出，一条需求一份。

```
Requirement ID: REQ-<id>
Source Input Level: IDEA_LEVEL | PRODUCT_LEVEL | ENGINEERING_LEVEL
Original Statement: <用户原话>
Preserved Intent: <重述的核心目标，不得偏离用户实际所求>

Completed Requirements:
  - <补全项>  [AI_RECOMMENDED-COMPLETION]

Derived Engineering Preconditions:
  - <例如：需要持久化的登录态存储>

Boundary & Exception Analysis:
  - <考虑到的边界情况>

Non-Functional Requirements:
  Performance: ...
  Security: ...
  Compatibility: ...

Acceptance Criteria:
  - AC-01: ...

Assumptions: [ASM-<id>, ...]   （见 ASSUMPTION_REGISTER_TEMPLATE）

Definition of Ready: PASS | NOT_READY（原因）
Traceability: REQ-<id> → DESIGN-<id> → TASK-<id> → ...
Status: DRAFT | BASELINED | DRIFTED | SUPERSEDED
```
